\begin_layout Standard
By default,
 all pads come out of reset ready to use with input enabled and output disable set to 0.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Regardless,
 gpio_set_function in the SDK sets the input enable and clears the output disable to engage the pad’s IO buffers and connect internal signals to the outside world.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Finally the desired function select is written to the IO control register (see GPIO0_CTRL for an example of an IO control register).
\end_layout

